fields.value:
 * This {{M|sub-ability}} has two main components:
** Replaces {{A|Lion|Finger of Death}} until the buff duration expires.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]] {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*** The ability effects are applied as follows:
***# {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|lion_finger_punch}}
***#* {{hi|Lion}} {{Symbol|Ranged}} {{to}} {{hi|Lion}} {{Symbol|Melee}} 
***#** Turns Lion into a [[melee]] unit with [[cleave]] upon ability cast, even if the {{M|Spell Block}} source procs on the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy.
***#* {{Symbol|Cleave}}
***#** Deals {{M|physical}} {{M|spell damage|t=x}} correspondingly to Lion's attack damage value, and is defined as:
***#*** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|[[Cleave]]Dmg {{=}} [[Attack Damage#Total Attack Damage|ΣAtkDmg]] × f(Cleave)}}
***#** Affected by {{M|damage block}} sources on the enemy individually within the area-of-effect.
***#** Has the following damage flags:
***#*** {{M|No-spell-lifesteal}}
***#*** {{M|No-spell-amplification}}
***#** Stack independently with other {{M|cleave|x}} sources.
***#** {{hi|Lion}} {{Symbol|Facing Angle|r}} {{Symbol|Target|Cleave90|size=42px}}
***#*** The total ability area-of-effect is an [[wikipedia:Isosceles trapezoid|isocseles trapezoid]] in front of Lion.
***# Grants flat {{M|bonus attack damage}} for the duration, and is defined as:
***#* {{cf|expr}} {{Code|{{#var:Fist of Death type2 value2}} + ({{#var:Fist of Death type2 value3}} + {{ValueColor||{{Show|T|Lion|v3r}}|tal|x}}) × f(Stack)}}
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*** The ability effects are applied as follows:
***# Lion's attack instance.
***# Applies a {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|lion_finger_of_death_delay}} {{#var:Finger of Death value1}}-second debuff on the affected enemy unit.
***#* Reapplying the debuff refreshes its duration.
***#* Other {{A|Lion|Finger of Death}} notes apply.
***#* This debuff component is applied to all {{M|cleave}}-affected enemy units per successful attack while {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|lion_finger_punch}} is active.

 * {{Symbol|Cleave}}
** The damage is applied immediately to all valid enemy units within the area-of-effect regardless of the ability visual effects.
** Does not proc [[cleave]] when attacking the following units:
*** {{M|Allied units|x}}.
** Does not damage the following units:
*** {{M|Couriers}}
** Neither proc nor damage the following units:
*** {{M|Buildings}}
*** {{M|Ward-type units}}.

